{"id":"9bb2f4d85fff40f1","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-definability.md","title":"Definability","display":"df-definability — Definability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-definability","aliases":["93-df-definability"],"display":"df-definability — Definability","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definability — Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq A^n\">\\(S\\subseteq A^n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar v_n\">\\(\\bar v_n\\)</span> is the canonical tuple of the first <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> variables and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is first-order tuple satisfaction.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced formula set and free-variable map; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> is its mnemonic sort tag.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Definable}^{0}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Definable}^{0}_{93}\\)</span> is parameter-free definability in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Definable}^{0}_{93}(S,n;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land S\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n(\\bar a\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar v_n])\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Definable}^{0}_{93}(S,n;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land S\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n(\\bar a\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar v_n])\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Arity, structure, and language are explicit arguments. No elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> occur as parameters in the defining formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar v_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Definable}^{0}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Definable}^{0}_{93}(S,n;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land S\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|^n\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_n)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n(\\bar a\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar v_n])\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e9e2c1c3d7432b0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c000d6833b849019","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["84c35fea1e867240","0ce709e0d2857990","56c1f813209c75e1"]}